        },
        {
          "locator": "line 8",
          "text": "Please use the attached management model as the provisional basis for the draft. The GBP 1.2m difference against the briefing remains unresolved and must remain visible in the draft. This is not confirmation that the model has been audited."
        },
        {
          "locator": "line 10",
          "text": "The P&L tab is in GBP millions. The CustomerSales and ServiceMix tabs are in GBP thousands. They cover FY2025 recognised revenue, excluding VAT, for the same UK company. CustomerSales contains the five largest customers plus one aggregate row for all others. Do not treat that aggregate as a single customer."
        },
        {
          "locator": "line 12",
          "text": "The model is version 2.0, dated 21 January 2026. The forecast is management's base case. There is no customer-level forecast bridge or recruitment cost schedule yet."
        }
      ]
